23
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:33,620
it is for us.

24
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:34,480
Seven times.

25
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:35,540
Mercury is small.

26
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:36,460
It's only a little bigger than

27
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:37,220
