30
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:43,340
Now imagine you land on the

31
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:45,020
side facing the Sun.

32
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:46,860
The ground under your boots reaches

33
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:49,200
around 430 degrees Celsius.

34
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:50,780
That's hot enough to melt lead.

35
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:52,040
Every rock around you is glowing

36
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:53,040
with heat.

37
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:54,220
The sky is black, but the

38
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:55,480
light is blinding.

39
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,520
Now walk away from the Sun.

40
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:58,780
Just keep walking until you cross

41
00:00:58,780 --> 00:01:00,800
