42
00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:02,160
And here is where the story

43
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:03,920
turns strange.

44
00:01:04,960 --> 00:01:06,780
On the night side, the temperature

45
00:01:06,780 --> 00:01:08,640
