165
00:04:04,260 --> 00:04:05,440
That's what makes it so disturbing.

166
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:07,800
And I haven't even told you

167
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,060
why this place is not peaceful

168
00:04:09,060 --> 00:04:09,900
yet.

169
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,780
Let's talk about the sunrise.

170
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:15,160
On Earth, the Sun comes up,

171
00:04:15,160 --> 00:04:16,860
