172
00:04:16,860 --> 00:04:17,680
Simple.

173
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:18,780
On Mercury,

174
00:04:18,780 --> 00:04:19,600
if you stand in the right

175
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:21,620
spot, the Sun rises, then it

176
00:04:21,620 --> 00:04:22,380
