192
00:04:44,080 --> 00:04:45,820
A sunrise that hesitates.

193
00:04:45,980 --> 00:04:48,260
And the surface is even stranger.

194
00:04:48,660 --> 00:04:50,260
When scientists studied Mercury with the

195
00:04:50,260 --> 00:04:52,420
