208
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,520
Mercury is getting smaller.

209
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:13,480
Not in a movie.

210
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:14,440
Right now.

211
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,780
So think about what this planet

212
00:05:15,780 --> 00:05:16,820
