217
00:05:20,820 --> 00:05:22,320
A Sun that moves backward.

218
00:05:22,320 --> 00:05:24,240
Peaceful? Not even close.

219
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:26,000
But I promised you something frozen

220
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,420
that should not exist.

221
00:05:27,420 --> 00:05:28,920
And now it's time.

222
00:05:29,980 --> 00:05:31,960
For decades, astronomers pointed radar at

223
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:33,100
