236
00:05:50,300 --> 00:05:52,080
It mapped the poles in detail.

237
00:05:52,080 --> 00:05:53,960
And what it found changed everything.

238
00:05:54,080 --> 00:05:55,940
Mercury has water ice.

239
00:05:56,140 --> 00:05:57,480
Here's how it's possible.

240
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:58,560
Mercury barely tilts.

241
00:05:58,560 --> 00:06:00,560
Its spin axis is almost perfectly

242
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,300
