274
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:50,600
So was the title true?

275
00:06:50,660 --> 00:06:52,380
Mercury isn't the coldest planet.

276
00:06:52,380 --> 00:06:53,700
But it's the only planet where

277
00:06:53,700 --> 00:06:54,760
the hottest day and one of

278
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:55,820
