283
00:07:01,100 --> 00:07:01,940
No blanket.

284
00:07:01,940 --> 00:07:02,920
No mercy.

285
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:05,000
So the next time someone tells

286
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,260
you the closest planet to the

287
00:07:06,260 --> 00:07:07,860
